          {
            "title": "Find the risky operation",
            "id": 152111,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um texto de quantidade inválido pode gerar <code>ValueError</code>. Qual operação um bloco <code>try</code> específico deve proteger contra essa falha esperada?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"order_import.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Importing&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"quantity = int(form[\" /><text value=\"&quot;quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"save_order(form, quantity)\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Convertendo <code>form[\"quantity\"]</code> com <code>int()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Exibindo a mensagem de importação</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Salvando o pedido concluído</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Convertendo <code>form[\"quantity\"]</code> com <code>int()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Salvar também pode gerar <code>ValueError</code>, mas só um texto de quantidade inválido deve acionar o aviso. O que pertence ao <code>try</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"order_import.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Importing&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"quantity = int(form[\" /><text value=\"&quot;quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"save_order(form, quantity)\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Apenas converter form[\"quantity\"] com int().</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">A conversão e save_order() juntas.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Apenas save_order().</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">As três linhas, para que qualquer ValueError produza o aviso de quantidade.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Apenas converter form[\"quantity\"] com int().</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Keep the try block narrow",
            "id": 152112,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete o bloco em foco em torno da conversão da quantidade.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"order_import.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"process\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(form)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Importing&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    quantity = int(form[\" /><text value=\"&quot;quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"None\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" quantity\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"45\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>try</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Catch the expected error",
            "id": 152113,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Capture apenas o erro esperado de um texto numérico inválido.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"seat_parser.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"parse_seats\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(value)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" int(value)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"None\" class=\"literal\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"KeyError\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>ValueError</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Capture apenas texto numérico inválido e retorne um valor de falha sem inventar uma quantidade de assentos.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"seat_parser.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"parse_seats\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(value)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" int(value)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"None\" class=\"literal\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"KeyError\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Exception\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>ValueError</code> seguido de <code>None</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Choose the recovery point",
            "id": 152114,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>parse_port()</code> converte texto. <code>start_server()</code> pode cancelar a inicialização e mostrar uma mensagem útil. Onde <code>ValueError</code> deve ser capturado?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Dentro de <code>start_server()</code>, perto da chamada de <code>parse_port()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Dentro de <code>parse_port()</code>, antes de chamar <code>int()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Dentro da função integrada <code>int()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Dentro de <code>start_server()</code>, perto da chamada de <code>parse_port()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dois chamadores usam <code>parse_port()</code>, mas só <code>start_server()</code> pode cancelar a inicialização. Onde deve ficar a recuperação?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Capture ValueError em start_server() ao redor da chamada a parse_port().</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Capture-o em parse_port() e sempre retorne 0 para todos os chamadores.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Capture-o nas duas funções, com parse_port() retornando 0 primeiro.</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Capture-o depois que a chamada parse_port() já tiver terminado.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Capture ValueError em start_server() ao redor da chamada a parse_port().</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Keep other work visible",
            "id": 152115,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quais partes do código devem ser movidas para fora do bloco <code>try</code> para tornar o tratamento de erros mais direcionado?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"order_import.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  quantity = int(order[\" /><text value=\"&quot;quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  total = quantity * order[\" /><text value=\"&quot;price&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  save_order(total)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Invalid quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">O cálculo do total e a chamada de <code>save_order()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">A conversão da quantidade</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Cada linha na função</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">O cálculo do total e a chamada de <code>save_order()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A quantidade é válida, mas <code>save_order()</code> gera um <code>ValueError</code>. Só falhas na quantidade devem exibir o aviso. O que deve sair?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"order_import.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  quantity = int(order[\" /><text value=\"&quot;quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  total = quantity * order[\" /><text value=\"&quot;price&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  save_order(total)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Invalid quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">O cálculo do total e a chamada save_order().</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Apenas a conversão da quantidade.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Apenas o cálculo do total; mantenha save_order() protegido.</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Nada; tipos de exceção iguais sempre precisam da mesma resposta.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">O cálculo do total e a chamada save_order().</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Handle a missing key",
            "id": 152116,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Conclua o primeiro manipulador específico para uma chave de quantidade ausente.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"order_import.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"parse_quantity\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(order)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" int(order[\" /><text value=\"&quot;quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" KeyError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Missing quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Invalid quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ValueError\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>KeyError</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Retorne mensagens separadas para uma chave de quantidade ausente e um texto de número inteiro inválido.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"order_import.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"parse_quantity\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(order)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" int(order[\" /><text value=\"&quot;quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" KeyError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Missing quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Invalid quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option startIndex=\"149\" endIndex=\"167\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ValueError\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Missing quantity&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"TypeError\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>KeyError</code> seguido de <code>\"Invalid quantity\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Protect a port setting",
            "id": 152117,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que acontece se <code>settings[\"port\"]</code> contiver um valor como <code>\"abc\"</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  port = int(settings[\" /><text value=\"&quot;port&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Invalid port&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" port\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">A função retorna <code>\"Invalid port\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">A função retorna <code>\"abc\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">A função retorna <code>0</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">A função retorna <code>\"Invalid port\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dentro desta função, o que acontece se <code>settings</code> não tiver a chave <code>\"port\"</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  port = int(settings[\" /><text value=\"&quot;port&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Invalid port&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" port\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">KeyError sai da função porque este handler não o captura.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">A função retorna \"Invalid port\".</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">A função retorna 0.</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">A função retorna None após capturar o erro.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">KeyError sai da função porque este handler não o captura.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Check a focused handler",
            "id": 152118,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>process_order()</code> pode ignorar um pedido. Qual design mantém o manipulador focado e permite que falhas não relacionadas venham à tona?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Capture <code>ValueError</code> em torno da conversão de quantidade em <code>process_order()</code> e, em seguida, calcule e salve fora do manipulador</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Coloque a conversão, o cálculo e o salvamento em um bloco <code>except</code> simples</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Capture todos os erros dentro do auxiliar de conversão e retorne <code>0</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Capture <code>ValueError</code> em torno da conversão de quantidade em <code>process_order()</code> e, em seguida, calcule e salve fora do manipulador.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          }
        ]
